{"name": "Feed The Void", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Feed the Void is an incremental game where you play cards to pass trials.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"322\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476320/extras/41dd28017b861d35bb807bb67c4d515d.poster.avif?t=1779890856\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476320/extras/41dd28017b861d35bb807bb67c4d515d.webm?t=1779890856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476320/extras/41dd28017b861d35bb807bb67c4d515d.mp4?t=1779890856\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Spend tokens earned from trials to upgrade your deck. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"268\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476320/extras/e6add0aba21cd3ecf7f8b8f220085d3e.poster.avif?t=1779890856\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476320/extras/e6add0aba21cd3ecf7f8b8f220085d3e.webm?t=1779890856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476320/extras/e6add0aba21cd3ecf7f8b8f220085d3e.mp4?t=1779890856\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Between runs, unlock game-changing features like relics, transient runes, and unique decks.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476320/extras/483945cd61b340e89230e67b86234873.avif?t=1779890856\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control how far you take a strategy. You don\u2019t lose your progress if you don\u2019t pass a trial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You control the deck, not RNG. Your strategy is not forced upon you at the whim of lady luck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paradigm shifts. New abilities and mechanics will fundamentally change the game multiple times as you progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476320/extras/a72d75f0bd0bd7ba57343fe90da4f1b5.poster.avif?t=1779890856\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476320/extras/a72d75f0bd0bd7ba57343fe90da4f1b5.webm?t=1779890856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476320/extras/a72d75f0bd0bd7ba57343fe90da4f1b5.mp4?t=1779890856\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "An incremental deckbuilder where you shape your deck the way you desire. Upgrade cards, unlock synergies, play massive combos, and constantly discover game-changing abilities.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4476320/6d6f5ed07b0bd5d35c85ff0464744e8e937e947f/header.jpg?t=1779890856", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Card Game", "Strategy", "Deckbuilding", "Resource Management", "Casual", "Pixel Graphics"], "developers": "Barribob", "publishers": "Barribob", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4476320", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "26 March 2026 - Request Access\n\n22 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/WrteWM2AP6o", "fi